      "message": "`ValidateAndGetIsa` accepts any ISA in [this list](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/libartbase/arch/instruction_set.cc;l\u003d62-72;drc\u003d77c14d181dcec8cec240cf2a99a401397582c6d8) regardless of ISAs supported by the device, so we are not that strict.\n\nOn the other hand, long story short, the input string comes from [`getAllAbis`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/libartservice/service/java/com/android/server/art/Utils.java;l\u003d111;drc\u003d118b0803594c21065509c5ae6802f629c9a9c1a5) or [`getAllAbisForNames`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/libartservice/service/java/com/android/server/art/Utils.java;l\u003d137;drc\u003d118b0803594c21065509c5ae6802f629c9a9c1a5), both of which only returns native ISAs (after translation, if needed).",
