      "lineNbr": 323,
      "author": {
        "id": 1884045
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-20T16:39:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We are using the struct `SecureDexMetadataWithCompanionPaths` to represent both the SDM and SDC files and get paths of both from the same object (see `artd/artd.cc` line 1002-1003), so, for SDM, `isInDalvikCache` doesn\u0027t apply and is possible to have either value. We do want to accept both `isInDalvikCache` being true and false and return the same result in both cases.",
      "parentUuid": "da45bbe8_575c57af",
      "revId": "00b78c2ad4f44e11ffe5d588a01ec655c8a95616",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c20ebc01_7b134ca2",
