        "id": 1373864
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-20T19:33:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, tricky. As discussed offline, please:\n\n1) Add a comment to the `isInDalvikCache` field in the AIDL file explaining that it\u0027s not applicable to SDM files because they\u0027re next to the dex file even when dalvik-cache is used, and that can happen (at least) for incremental-fs (since it\u0027s easy to forget that dalvik-cache is used for more than just system partition apps).\n\n2) Add a comment here that it\u0027s intentional that `isInDalvikCache` is ignored, referring the comment above.",
      "parentUuid": "2d7a5406_d4862133",
      "revId": "00b78c2ad4f44e11ffe5d588a01ec655c8a95616",
